---
layout: base.njk
title: Parties, private hire & work dos
ogTitle: "Private hire at the Belle · Five London pubs for your do"
description: "Birthdays, wedding receptions, work socials, breakfast briefings, watch parties and wakes. Beach huts in Hammersmith, a balcony over Battersea Power Station, and room for 200 at the Moretown."
og: hire
permalink: /private-hire/
bodyClass: page-hire
---
<section class="menu-hero">
  <div class="photo">{% img "duchess-terrace", "The Duchess Belle terrace looking across to Battersea Power Station", "100vw", "", true %}</div>
  <div class="wrap menu-hero__inner">
    <p class="kicker" style="color:var(--butter)">Parties & private hire</p>
    <h1>Your do. Our place.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Birthdays, baby showers, leaving dos, wedding receptions, stag and hen dos, team socials and wakes. Every area at every Belle can be hired, from a beach hut to the whole pub.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--rose" href="#enquire">Enquire about a date</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="rule-head">Five pubs, five ways to party</h2>
    <div class="spaces">
      {%- for s in [
        { v: "hammersmith", img: "hammersmith-jug", title: "A beach hut of your own", cap: "Garden for up to 300", text: "Hire one of the beach huts in the Belle Enchanted Garden, or the whole 8,000 sq ft garden with its sports pergola and a castle to keep the kids busy." },
        { v: "duchess", img: "duchess-terrace", title: "First-floor bar & balcony", cap: "Private upstairs bar", text: "Wedding receptions, birthdays and baby showers with Battersea Power Station across the road. An affordable space, and it looks anything but." },
        { v: "moretown", img: "moretown-500s", title: "The Moretown, any part or all of it", cap: "Up to 120 seated · 200 standing", text: "Five sound zones, five darts boards and three pool tables for team building that doesn't feel like it." },
        { v: "griffin", img: "griffin-banquettes", title: "The Griffin", cap: "Areas for hire · 14 rooms upstairs", text: "Birthdays, anniversaries and leaving dos in Vauxhall, with beds upstairs for anyone who'd rather not go home." },
        { v: "fitzrovia", img: "fitzrovia-frontbar", title: "Fitzrovia's two bars", cap: "Areas for hire · 5 rooms upstairs", text: "Company gatherings and celebrations on Tottenham Court Road, a short walk from Goodge Street and Warren Street." },
        { v: "hammersmith", img: "hammersmith-darts", title: "The darts lounge", cap: "5 oches", text: "Book the oches for the office tournament. Flower walls, scoreboards and a bar a few steps away." }
      ] %}{% set v = venues | venue(s.v) %}
      <article class="space">
        <span class="photo">{% img s.img, s.title, "(min-width: 1140px) 33vw, (min-width: 760px) 50vw, 100vw" %}</span>
        <div class="space__body">
          <a class="space__logo" href="{{ ('/' + v.slug + '/') | u }}">{% logo v.logo, v.name %}</a>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p class="space__cap">{{ s.cap }}</p>
          <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
          <p><button class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" type="button" data-book data-book-tab="party" data-venue="{{ v.slug }}">Enquire here</button></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section belle-blue">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">For work</p>
      <h2>Meetings, briefings & the bit after</h2>
      <p>The Moretown sits in the middle of an office square by St Katharine Docks and opens at 8am, so it's set up for meetings, breakfast briefings and presentations.</p>
      <p>Then there's the team social, the leaving do, the client drinks and the Christmas party. Jane at head office handles corporate bookings across all five Belles.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--ink" href="mailto:jane@bellepubsandrestaurants.co.uk?subject=Corporate%20booking">Email Jane White</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:4/3">{% img "moretown-booths", "Booths and glass frontage at the Moretown Belle", "(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wash" id="enquire">
  <div class="wrap enquire">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Tell us what you're planning</p>
      <h2>Let's find you the right room</h2>
      <p>Not sure which Belle suits? Leave it on "Help me choose" and we'll suggest one. We'll come back with spaces, food and drink options and a deposit link.</p>
      <ul class="facts-row"><li>Birthdays</li><li>Baby showers</li><li>Wedding receptions</li><li>Stag & hen dos</li><li>Leaving dos</li><li>Quiz nights</li><li>Wakes</li><li>Watch parties</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="enquire__form frame">
      {% set partyOccasion = "" %}{% set showMenuChoice = false %}{% include "partials/party-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
